# Kiro Ignore File
# Prevents AI from reading unnecessary files to save tokens

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/**
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Build outputs
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/out/**
**/.nuxt/**
**/.output/**

# Coverage reports
**/coverage/**
**/.nyc_output/**

# Environment files (contain secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# IDE files
**/.vscode/**
**/.idea/**
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/desktop.ini

# Git
**/.git/**
**/.gitignore

# Logs
**/logs/**
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/lerna-debug.log*

# Cache
**/.cache/**
**/.parcel-cache/**
**/.eslintcache
**/.stylelintcache

# Testing
**/__tests__/**
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.jsx

# Documentation (read only when needed)
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/LICENSE
**/CONTRIBUTING.md

# Static assets (images, fonts, etc.)
**/public/images/**
**/public/fonts/**
**/uploads/**
**/assets/images/**
**/assets/fonts/**

# Generated files
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.d.ts.map

# Temporary files
**/tmp/**
**/temp/**
**/.tmp/**

# Database files
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db

# Backup files
**/*.backup
**/*.bak
**/*.old

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Specific to this project
backend-landing-xaydung/uploads/**
frontend-landing-xaydung/public/images/**
frontend-landing-xaydung/.next/**
backend-landing-xaydung/dist/**

# Keep these documentation files accessible
!.kiro/steering/**
!**/RULES.md
!**/AGENTS.md
!**/IMAGE_URL_UPDATE_COMPLETE.md
